<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
  <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
All mediators have been drafted to the dispute #{{disputeId}}. This means the
dispute has entered the <b>evidence collection phase</b>. In this phase, you are
expected to submit evidence to back your preferred outcome or defend your
position.
<br><br>
If you want the swap released, provide evidences indicating you
have made payment. If you want the swap cancelled, provide a reason and
evidences for while the swap should be cancelled.
<br><br>
After the evidence collection phase, the mediators will begin the mediation
process. The mediators will use the evidences you and the counterparty provide
to decide the dispute outcome. <b style="color: indianred;">Failure to provide
  evidence may lead to undesirable outcome against you</b>
<br><br>
Evidence Phase Ends In: <b style="font-size:
22px; color: darkolivegreen;">{{evidencePhaseHoursLeft}}</b>
<br><br>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">View Swap Order</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">How Disputes Work</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
</body>
</html>
